WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.400
SCP-682 Vs The Gate Guardian.&nbsp;
Can the giant warrior with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.680
sword hotter than the sun finally&nbsp;
kill the Hard to Destroy Reptile?

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:12.320
When SCP-682 was brought in to hopefully&nbsp;
meet its ultimate destruction at the Gate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:15.920
the Guardian Guards, it quipped,&nbsp;
“Is this meant to be the Garden?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.520
This is not the Garden. The&nbsp;
Garden is far west of here.”

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:26.560
When the Gate Guardian struck 682, it was&nbsp;
grievously wounded, with only a single leg left.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:31.600
As it regenerated, it snarled at the Gate&nbsp;
Guardian, saying, “Die? You command me&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:38.000
to die? Oh, wouldn't we all like that, but&nbsp;
this is my curse for suggesting the fruit.”&nbsp;

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.760
It struck again, and before passing&nbsp;
out from its injuries, 682 said,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:47.440
“This is not the Garden, and&nbsp;
you are not Uriel. Pretender.”

